| Node | Height | Branches to Children |
| --- | --- | --- |
| [ac]{color=#D40000} | 2 | a: 2; c: 2 |
| [be]{color=#6C6C00} | 3 | b: 3; e: 3 |
| [df]{color=#00775F} | 4 | d: 4; f: 4 |
